{#- One footer everywhere — it is the site's sitemap, and every page needs it.
    Anchors are prefixed with {{ home }} so a subpage's "Services" link goes to
    the homepage section instead of nowhere. -#}
  <footer class="footer" id="contact">
    <div class="container">
      {#- The finale (immersive-plan §11): the CTA fills with gold as you
          scroll toward it, over a ghost of the SAME phrase in the OTHER
          language — the one brand fact no competitor shares, used as the
          design device. i18n.js keeps the pair inverted on every swap via
          data-i18n-alt. Without JS the gold layer simply shows filled. -#}
      <div class="footer__cta reveal">
        <p class="footer__cta-label" data-i18n="footer.ctaLabel">Start a project</p>
        <div class="footer__cta-stack">
          <span class="footer__cta-title footer__cta-title--ghost" aria-hidden="true" data-i18n-alt="footer.ctaTitle">Hablemos</span>
          <a href="/contact.html" class="footer__cta-title footer__cta-title--fill" data-i18n="footer.ctaTitle">Let's Talk</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__contact">
        <div class="footer__contact-item">
          <span class="footer__contact-label" data-i18n="footer.emailLabel">New Business</span>
          <a href="mailto:hey@creativemk.net" class="footer__contact-value">hey@creativemk.net</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer__contact-item">
          <span class="footer__contact-label" data-i18n="footer.phoneLabel">Project Path</span>
          <a href="/contact.html" class="footer__contact-value" data-i18n="footer.projectPath">Send a brief</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__main">
        <div>
          <h2 class="footer__column-title" data-i18n="footer.navigation">Navigation</h2>
          <ul class="footer__nav-list">
            <li><a href="/work/" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.work">Work</a></li>
            <li><a href="/lab/" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.lab">Lab</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ home }}#capabilities" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.services">Services</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ home }}#about" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.about">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ home }}#news" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.blog">Insights</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact.html" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.contact">Contact</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="footer__column-title" data-i18n="footer.services">Services</h2>
          <ul class="footer__nav-list">
            <li><a href="{{ home }}#capabilities" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.webDesign">Websites</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ home }}#capabilities" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.uxui">UX/UI Design</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ home }}#capabilities" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.metaAds">Growth &amp; Marketing</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ home }}#capabilities" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.branding">Branding</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ home }}#capabilities" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.appDev">Development</a></li>
            <li><a href="{{ home }}#ai-automation" class="footer__nav-link" data-i18n="nav.aiAutomation">AI Automation</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="footer__column-title" data-i18n="footer.office">Office</h2>
          <div class="footer__offices">
            <div class="footer__office">
              <span class="footer__office-city">CREATIVE MK HQ</span>
              <span class="footer__office-address" data-i18n="footer.address">Digital-first agency<br>Available worldwide</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="footer__column-title" data-i18n="footer.stayUpdated">Stay Updated</h2>
          <div class="footer__newsletter">
            <p class="footer__newsletter-text" data-i18n="footer.newsletterText">Get occasional notes on branding, UX, websites, growth systems, and practical AI.</p>
            <form class="footer__newsletter-form" id="newsletter-form">
              <input type="email" class="footer__newsletter-input" placeholder="Your email" data-i18n-placeholder="footer.emailPlaceholder" required>
              <button type="submit" class="footer__newsletter-btn" data-i18n="footer.subscribe">Subscribe</button>
            </form>
            <p class="footer__newsletter-success" id="newsletter-success" hidden>&#10003; <span data-i18n="footer.subscribeSuccess">Thanks for subscribing!</span></p>
            <div class="footer__social">
              <a href="/contact.html" class="footer__social-link" data-i18n="hero.primaryCta">Start a project</a>
              <a href="mailto:hey@creativemk.net" class="footer__social-link">Email</a>
              <a href="{{ home }}#capabilities" class="footer__social-link" data-i18n="nav.services">Services</a>
              <a href="{{ home }}#news" class="footer__social-link" data-i18n="nav.blog">Insights</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer__bottom">
        <p class="footer__copyright">&copy; 2026 CREATIVE MK. <span data-i18n="footer.rights">All rights reserved.</span></p>
        <div class="footer__legal">
          <a href="/privacy/" class="footer__legal-link" data-i18n="footer.privacy">Privacy Notice</a>
          <a href="/terms/" class="footer__legal-link" data-i18n="footer.terms">Service Terms</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
